WEBVTT

00:04.629 --> 00:07.090
This is all we managed to retrieve.

00:07.173 --> 00:09.718
We found it in the Guild's furnace.

00:09.801 --> 00:12.345
But most of it has been burned to ashes...

00:16.766 --> 00:17.726
This is...

00:18.226 --> 00:20.020
Is it some kind of token?

00:24.774 --> 00:26.901
Mahaeyzel Zelkoff.

00:28.028 --> 00:31.406
If we can find a way to capture that man...

00:31.489 --> 00:33.742
I don't think that's possible.

00:33.825 --> 00:36.619
He might have already fled the city.

00:36.703 --> 00:37.996
Or perhaps...

00:43.001 --> 00:44.127
That's not allowed.

00:44.210 --> 00:46.337
I can't let him out.

00:46.421 --> 00:49.883
Yes, I completely understand.

00:49.966 --> 00:52.051
But the situation has changed.

00:52.635 --> 00:55.513
We have to make an exception
and let him out.

00:57.557 --> 00:59.350
Is this real?

00:59.434 --> 01:01.019
Of course.

01:01.102 --> 01:03.521
There's even a seal from Galtuile here.

01:03.605 --> 01:06.816
The one in charge in the military
is quite reasonable.

01:06.900 --> 01:10.403
Oh, you can check all you want.

01:10.487 --> 01:13.114
However, locking up a hero like this

01:13.198 --> 01:15.450
isn't really much of a punishment, is it?

01:15.533 --> 01:20.330
Locking him in there is basically
just letting him sleep peacefully,

01:21.206 --> 01:22.373
right?

01:26.336 --> 01:28.671
Give me some time. I'll go check.

01:28.755 --> 01:30.507
Please, go ahead.

03:06.269 --> 03:09.147
I want to go out, my knight.

03:09.731 --> 03:11.816
Don't you ever feel the same?

03:11.900 --> 03:14.736
You love zeff butter way too much.

03:14.819 --> 03:17.071
I cannot take this ban
on going out anymore.

03:17.155 --> 03:18.948
I want to go out!

03:20.199 --> 03:21.826
It's no use telling me that...

03:21.910 --> 03:23.536
Well then, Goddess.

03:23.620 --> 03:27.498
I recommend that you go
to the Dujin Art Museum.

03:28.291 --> 03:31.419
It has all kinds
of mid-century classical artifacts.

03:31.502 --> 03:35.798
The building itself was also built
with modern Nashida techniques.

03:35.882 --> 03:38.009
There's a lot to see.

03:38.092 --> 03:40.220
Ioff City is a major shipping hub.

03:40.303 --> 03:42.931
- It's full of all kinds of treasures.
- What's so fun about an art museum?

03:43.014 --> 03:44.891
If you want to take a walk,
go to the beach.

03:45.683 --> 03:47.477
The scenery is beautiful
when you fly over the coast.

03:48.061 --> 03:50.605
Flying into the forest
for a hunt is nice too.

03:50.688 --> 03:52.815
You're talking as if we can fly?

03:53.483 --> 03:56.527
Don't base everything on dragons.

03:57.111 --> 03:59.030
What? You got a problem with that?

03:59.113 --> 04:01.449
W-Well, we can go anywhere.

04:01.532 --> 04:03.159
Anyway, let us go into town.

04:03.743 --> 04:04.953
- I don't think that's possible.
- What?

04:05.036 --> 04:07.622
Did you forget we were attacked
in the city last time?

04:07.705 --> 04:09.540
The higher-ups won't allow it.

04:09.624 --> 04:12.418
What? No way...

04:12.502 --> 04:13.836
No.

04:13.920 --> 04:15.546
There's still a way to get permission.

04:15.630 --> 04:17.048
Really?

04:17.131 --> 04:19.384
Going to the Temple
shouldn't be a problem.

04:19.467 --> 04:20.927
It's very close to the barracks,

04:21.010 --> 04:23.263
so they can provide full protection.

04:23.346 --> 04:26.724
Kivia, you do say pleasant things
once in a while.

04:26.808 --> 04:28.476
Did something happen?

04:28.559 --> 04:30.728
Yes, that's quite rare.

04:30.812 --> 04:32.522
It's nothing...

04:32.605 --> 04:36.359
I only wanted to cheer Lady Teoritta up.

04:36.442 --> 04:37.652
Exactly.

04:37.735 --> 04:40.363
Xylo, you should try to cheer me up too.

04:40.446 --> 04:42.240
You actually said that yourself...

04:43.533 --> 04:47.287
Xylo, you should go greet
High Priest Marlen as well.

04:47.370 --> 04:50.748
I'll gather some trustworthy soldiers.

04:50.832 --> 04:52.458
Aren't you coming?

04:54.877 --> 04:56.296
I...

04:57.171 --> 04:58.423
have a lot to do.

05:00.008 --> 05:01.134
Got it.

05:01.217 --> 05:03.177
I'll take care of Teoritta.

05:08.182 --> 05:11.561
- Goddess!
- Lady Teoritta, Goddess of Swords!

05:11.644 --> 05:13.438
Please sign my book!

05:13.521 --> 05:15.356
Mine too!

05:15.440 --> 05:16.733
Leave it to me!

05:17.317 --> 05:21.738
The great Goddess Teoritta
will bestow blessings upon you all!

05:21.821 --> 05:22.864
Wonderful!

05:22.947 --> 05:25.450
- Then me too!
- Me too, Lady Teoritta!

05:25.533 --> 05:28.828
- They say the Goddess's autograph
- Lady Teoritta, my sister's too, please!

05:28.911 --> 05:29.829
- can ward off disaster,
- And

05:29.912 --> 05:32.498
- but people still believe in that.
- my mom's too!

05:32.582 --> 05:34.167
Alright, once you get it signed,
move along.

05:35.710 --> 05:37.128
Goddess,

05:37.211 --> 05:39.756
please enjoy these.

05:39.839 --> 05:41.883
You're as small as my grandson,

05:41.966 --> 05:45.261
yet you're fighting the Demon Blight.

05:45.344 --> 05:46.721
Yes, that is absolutely right.

05:46.804 --> 05:48.973
I am great.

05:49.057 --> 05:50.349
What do you think, my knight?

05:50.433 --> 05:52.810
This is the Goddess's long-cherished wish.

05:52.894 --> 05:54.771
Surely you feel quite proud as well.

05:54.854 --> 05:56.981
Oh, I will share my snacks with you too.

05:57.065 --> 05:58.316
Thank you.

05:58.399 --> 06:00.485
- After all, I have to taste it for poison.
- Ah!

06:01.069 --> 06:02.737
- I'm sorry, Granny.
- Is that the Soaring Lightning?

06:02.820 --> 06:04.489
- I'll take it for now.
- That Demon Lord Killer?

06:04.572 --> 06:07.075
That's Xylo Forbartz, the Thunder Falcon.

06:07.158 --> 06:09.118
- What?
- I wonder if I can get his autograph.

06:09.202 --> 06:11.245
They know about me too?

06:11.329 --> 06:14.040
You're quite popular.

06:14.749 --> 06:16.334
High Priest Marlen...

06:17.335 --> 06:20.630
Your mission at Mureed Fortress
and your performance at Sodrick's Shell

06:20.713 --> 06:23.007
seem to have earned you
quite a bit of praise.

06:24.008 --> 06:26.010
I'm a penal hero, you know.

06:26.094 --> 06:28.721
- Ah, it's His Eminence!
- The children probably don't understand

06:28.805 --> 06:30.056
- E-Excuse us.
- the meaning of that yet.

06:30.139 --> 06:32.642
- Alright, let's go.
- I've changed my opinion of you too.

06:32.725 --> 06:33.559
Okay...

06:33.643 --> 06:36.229
I've heard a lot about you from my niece.

06:38.106 --> 06:43.945
Patausche has a tendency to value honor
too highly and disregard her life.

06:44.862 --> 06:48.241
You could say she wants to be a hero.

06:48.741 --> 06:50.993
Don't you find that troublesome?

06:51.702 --> 06:52.870
Who knows...

06:53.454 --> 06:55.873
There are surprisingly
many people like that.

06:55.957 --> 06:58.876
Especially those
who fight the Demon Blight.

06:59.502 --> 07:01.921
As her uncle, it's normal
for you to be worried.

07:02.004 --> 07:03.339
Indeed...

07:03.422 --> 07:07.552
I treat Patausche like my own daughter.

07:07.635 --> 07:11.097
If anyone betrays her
and breaks her heart,

07:11.848 --> 07:13.015
I will never forgive them.

07:15.726 --> 07:17.645
Listen, Xylo Forbartz.

07:17.728 --> 07:20.148
Although you seem to have a fiancée...

07:20.940 --> 07:23.025
- What is it?
- This bell...

07:24.777 --> 07:26.446
Xylo, what happened?

07:26.529 --> 07:28.030
It's an enemy attack.

07:28.114 --> 07:30.992
The enemy has invaded Ioff City.

07:31.075 --> 07:33.202
We're under attack.

07:43.504 --> 07:45.089
What a coincidence.

07:45.173 --> 07:48.134
What are you doing here?

07:48.217 --> 07:52.388
Well, I noticed an error
in the report I submitted,

07:52.472 --> 07:54.807
so I must revise it right away...

07:54.891 --> 07:59.437
Many important military and Temple
documents are kept here.

07:59.520 --> 08:01.939
Only officers are allowed to enter.

08:02.023 --> 08:04.025
Ah, is that so?

08:04.108 --> 08:06.277
Then I apologize for barging in
without knowing the rules.

08:08.446 --> 08:11.407
We're in combat. Get out of here!

08:11.491 --> 08:14.494
Alright, alright.
I'll gather the hero unit right away.

08:14.577 --> 08:17.914
If possible, please don't mention
that we met here...

08:36.015 --> 08:40.853
Also, think about me. I'm the one
who has to make fake permits every time...

08:43.189 --> 08:44.565
Xylo.

08:45.566 --> 08:47.527
Hey, Comrade Xylo.

08:48.110 --> 08:50.363
I'm glad to see you so full of energy.

08:50.446 --> 08:53.658
You seemed busy while I was away.

08:53.741 --> 08:56.577
Even in the punishment room,
my heart ached for you.

08:56.661 --> 08:59.330
I see you still have
that fake smile on your face.

08:59.413 --> 09:02.250
This is the Goddess,

09:02.333 --> 09:03.501
right?

09:05.044 --> 09:07.171
Nice to meet you, Lady Teoritta.

09:07.755 --> 09:09.173
I'm Rhyno,

09:09.257 --> 09:13.427
the artilleryman for Penal Hero Unit 9004.

09:13.511 --> 09:16.973
Comrade Xylo and I
are like partners, right?

09:17.848 --> 09:19.267
We're not, okay?

09:19.350 --> 09:20.935
Hey, Venetim!

09:21.018 --> 09:23.563
Don't you think
it's too early to let him out?

09:23.646 --> 09:26.440
Just looking at his face
makes my blood boil!

09:26.524 --> 09:28.651
Weren't you the one
who told me to get him out?

09:28.734 --> 09:30.695
Seriously, you volunteered
to be a penal hero,

09:30.778 --> 09:32.196
but ended up in the punishment room...

09:32.280 --> 09:33.990
What exactly are you trying to do?

09:34.073 --> 09:37.743
I merely wish to dedicate myself
to the vulnerable people

09:37.827 --> 09:39.912
who are being ravaged by the faeries.

09:39.996 --> 09:42.456
What happened in the last operation
was unavoidable.

09:42.540 --> 09:46.752
You call firing a cannon
at a civilian home unavoidable?

09:46.836 --> 09:48.254
What are you even talking about?

09:48.337 --> 09:49.422
Alright, alright.

09:50.006 --> 09:52.049
Anyway, let's now work together

09:52.133 --> 09:54.844
and overcome this challenge.

09:56.053 --> 09:56.887
Now then...

09:57.597 --> 09:59.807
Ioff Cheg in the Port District.

09:59.890 --> 10:03.144
The faeries seemed to have appeared here.

10:03.227 --> 10:05.354
After that,
the horde of faeries began to move.

10:06.647 --> 10:07.773
They came to Tui Jia

10:07.857 --> 10:09.859
and occupied this coral tower.

10:11.068 --> 10:12.945
Isn't that an important
coastal defense facility?

10:16.198 --> 10:18.826
Among the faerie horde is the Demon Lord.

10:18.909 --> 10:21.579
There's a possibility that Tui Jia
has been turned into a faerie.

10:22.079 --> 10:23.414
- That's a decoy.
- It's a decoy.

10:25.499 --> 10:27.752
The enemy has artillery too, right?

10:27.835 --> 10:29.837
Judging from the current
wind direction and speed,

10:29.920 --> 10:33.424
they can bombard
all of Ioff Cheg from Tui Jia.

10:34.008 --> 10:36.886
In other words, they're holding
the entire area hostage?

10:37.470 --> 10:39.430
What are Galtuile's orders?

10:39.513 --> 10:41.891
Uh... about that...

10:42.516 --> 10:44.143
They've requested that
the Thirteenth Order of the Holy Knights

10:44.226 --> 10:47.688
and the Ioff City Defense Force
be deployed in the Inland District,

10:47.772 --> 10:51.359
with the hero unit defending
the Port District.

10:51.442 --> 10:52.318
What?!

10:53.027 --> 10:55.321
They want us to hold out
until reinforcements arrive

10:55.404 --> 10:58.324
before launching a counterattack.

10:58.824 --> 11:00.576
Wait until reinforcements arrive?

11:00.660 --> 11:02.870
So they're just going to let
the civilians in the Port District die?

11:02.953 --> 11:04.789
The N-Noble Alliance probably wants

11:04.872 --> 11:07.041
to prioritize defending
the Inland District.

11:07.124 --> 11:08.834
After all, the inland area

11:08.918 --> 11:11.295
contains the main institutions
and the nobles' assets.

11:12.088 --> 11:14.548
Damn it! They only care
about protecting themselves?

11:15.257 --> 11:16.217
Um...

11:16.717 --> 11:21.013
I think it's pointless to get hurt
or die in a battle like this.

11:21.097 --> 11:21.931
What?

11:22.014 --> 11:25.226
P-Perhaps it's better not to
get too actively involved...

11:25.810 --> 11:27.686
How brazen of you, Venetim.

11:28.270 --> 11:29.897
No matter how dire the situation is,

11:29.980 --> 11:33.651
we are the only ones
who can save the civilians now.

11:33.734 --> 11:36.904
This is a fight
worth risking our lives for.

11:37.947 --> 11:40.658
Hey, don't risk your life so easily.

11:40.741 --> 11:42.827
As expected of our Goddess.

11:42.910 --> 11:45.329
What a beautiful resolve.

11:45.413 --> 11:47.706
I completely agree.

11:47.790 --> 11:51.168
Comrade Xylo,
now's the time for us to fight.

11:51.252 --> 11:55.297
Let's join hands and do our best
for the people's future and hope!

11:55.381 --> 11:56.549
Shut up.

11:56.632 --> 11:58.259
It's just work, after all.

11:58.342 --> 12:01.220
Xylo, I know you can definitely do it.

12:01.303 --> 12:03.222
I believe in you.

12:04.807 --> 12:05.724
Alright.

12:06.308 --> 12:08.978
I won't let things go the way
those bastards want.

12:09.728 --> 12:12.148
Do not underestimate us.

12:15.568 --> 12:17.403
We'll build a bunker here.

12:17.486 --> 12:19.613
It'll be a refuge for the civilians.

12:19.697 --> 12:23.409
Erect the sacred seal barricade
according to my blueprint.

12:23.492 --> 12:24.535
Yes!

12:24.618 --> 12:26.579
Next, build a fire.

12:26.662 --> 12:29.915
Collect sacred seal-infused cookware
and food.

12:29.999 --> 12:31.041
Yes!

12:31.125 --> 12:33.919
Hey, why are those guys
from the Guild here?

12:34.003 --> 12:37.256
Apparently, His Majesty said
he'd introduce them to new jobs.

12:37.339 --> 12:40.134
He also said he'd give them
salaries and official posts.

12:40.217 --> 12:41.427
Official posts...

12:42.094 --> 12:44.263
Start by gathering wood.

12:44.346 --> 12:46.682
- Bring as much as you can!
- Yes, sir!

12:46.765 --> 12:50.603
- Hurry up! Don't dawdle!
- Well, it's better than being bandits.

13:02.156 --> 13:03.991
It is very hot, but it is delicious.

13:04.074 --> 13:05.284
Hey, Tatsuya.

13:06.076 --> 13:07.161
You should eat too.

13:09.830 --> 13:11.707
Idiot, don't eat with your hands!

13:12.791 --> 13:14.126
He is in a hurry to eat.

13:14.210 --> 13:16.712
No, you're spilling the soup too...

13:19.757 --> 13:22.593
Eating hot food will keep your morale up.

13:23.219 --> 13:26.514
You actually started
by setting up a cooking station.

13:26.597 --> 13:28.349
As expected of Comrade Norgalle.

13:28.432 --> 13:29.892
Impressive.

13:30.392 --> 13:32.937
Th-That is some incredible equipment.

13:33.020 --> 13:35.689
That's a Neven Artillery Seal Compound.

13:35.773 --> 13:39.777
But no one knows
why he's got this old-fashioned armor.

13:41.862 --> 13:45.115
I thought this would be
our first full-team battle in a while.

13:45.199 --> 13:48.953
Comrades Tsav and Jayce can't deploy?

13:49.620 --> 13:51.956
Tsav is still treating his arm.

13:52.039 --> 13:54.500
But given the current situation,

13:54.583 --> 13:56.961
I had him receive minimal treatment,
and he's on his way here.

13:58.003 --> 13:59.672
What about Comrade Jayce?

13:59.755 --> 14:01.882
Didn't they get permission to deploy?

14:01.966 --> 14:04.760
Venetim is helping with the negotiations.

14:04.843 --> 14:08.514
It's too dangerous to deploy
a flying dragon in the city,

14:08.597 --> 14:09.598
but we'll find a way.

14:10.182 --> 14:12.059
His Majesty can't leave the base.

14:12.643 --> 14:15.271
Dotta also needs to know
how the battle is going.

14:15.854 --> 14:18.232
The four of us will go to Tui Jia.

14:18.315 --> 14:20.192
In other words,

14:20.276 --> 14:23.112
we're completely understaffed.

14:23.737 --> 14:26.907
Then, may I make a suggestion?

14:28.701 --> 14:29.994
Let's hear it.

14:30.661 --> 14:33.497
Let's blow up this wall with artillery.

14:33.581 --> 14:35.833
If we let the faeries invade
the Inland District,

14:35.916 --> 14:38.794
soldiers other than us
will also be forced to fight.

14:38.878 --> 14:41.005
The manpower shortage will be solved.

14:41.589 --> 14:42.756
Huh?

14:43.340 --> 14:47.094
Hardship and suffering
should be shared by everyone.

14:47.177 --> 14:50.848
That's how humans deepen their bonds.
That's what makes them precious.

14:51.849 --> 14:54.351
My knight, this man...

14:54.435 --> 14:55.811
I know...

14:56.395 --> 14:57.563
Rejected.

14:57.646 --> 15:00.482
Don't put civilians in danger, idiot.

15:01.358 --> 15:04.320
Or do you have a better idea,
Comrade Xylo?

15:04.403 --> 15:05.529
Rhyno.

15:05.613 --> 15:08.782
It's not bonds
that drive ordinary people to act.

15:08.866 --> 15:10.075
It's self-interest.

15:11.285 --> 15:13.704
Bombard the ships docked in the harbor.

15:14.371 --> 15:16.749
With your ability, you should
be able to hit them from here.

15:17.249 --> 15:19.335
I see. Understood.

15:19.418 --> 15:21.337
As expected of Comrade Xylo.

15:21.420 --> 15:22.630
Next,

15:22.713 --> 15:24.340
we need to take that place.

15:24.924 --> 15:26.842
We'll suppress Tui Jia

15:26.926 --> 15:28.552
and kill the Demon Lord there.

15:37.645 --> 15:40.773
Commander Kivia, please issue
the orders for this mission.

15:40.856 --> 15:43.192
Yes, I'm on my way.

15:46.695 --> 15:49.114
No matter how many times I look at it,
it's still a ridiculously stupid order.

15:49.198 --> 15:50.824
It can't be helped.

15:50.908 --> 15:53.077
Support from the nobles is essential.

15:53.160 --> 15:56.789
Besides, there are many
Temple-related buildings in this area.

15:57.915 --> 16:00.793
Oh, I'm sorry to bother you.

16:00.876 --> 16:02.252
What is it?

16:02.336 --> 16:05.756
Didn't the hero unit receive
the order to deploy?

16:05.839 --> 16:11.303
Yes, as their commander,
I'll ensure they fight bravely.

16:11.804 --> 16:14.390
However, I heard
the docked sacred seal vessels

16:14.473 --> 16:17.434
were attacked by faeries.

16:17.518 --> 16:18.644
What did you say?

16:18.727 --> 16:22.940
We cannot afford to lose
any of the Temple's assets right now.

16:23.023 --> 16:26.402
So I'd like permission
to deploy the dragon.

16:26.485 --> 16:27.528
Impossible!

16:27.611 --> 16:30.656
Why would faeries attack
the sacred seal vessels first...

16:30.739 --> 16:31.824
Reporting!

16:31.907 --> 16:34.118
A large sacred seal vessel is on fire!

16:34.618 --> 16:35.452
What...

16:36.328 --> 16:39.039
There's been a rescue request
from the Temple.

16:41.458 --> 16:43.794
- Good work. You're dismissed.
- Yes!

16:47.256 --> 16:48.549
I see.

16:48.632 --> 16:50.050
It seems what you said is true.

16:50.134 --> 16:51.468
So that's really the case?

16:51.552 --> 16:55.264
When I first heard about it,
I couldn't believe my ears either.

16:55.347 --> 16:57.266
It's truly unfortunate.

16:59.476 --> 17:00.894
I understand.

17:00.978 --> 17:02.980
Permission granted to deploy the dragon.

17:03.063 --> 17:04.023
Commander!

17:04.106 --> 17:07.026
If the Temple has requested it,
then it's justified.

17:07.109 --> 17:09.319
We'll also mobilize
our troops immediately.

17:09.403 --> 17:12.114
Thank you for your understanding.

17:12.197 --> 17:13.699
Oh, one more thing.

17:13.782 --> 17:17.161
Please send my regards
to High Priest Marlen.

17:18.954 --> 17:21.373
You! What are you trying to say?

17:21.457 --> 17:23.333
Huh? No, I was just--

17:23.417 --> 17:25.127
Why did you mention my uncle?

17:25.210 --> 17:26.545
What are you implying?

17:26.628 --> 17:28.756
No... that's not it. I didn't...

17:30.132 --> 17:34.178
My uncle, High Priest Marlen,
is a great man!

17:34.261 --> 17:36.263
He devoted himself to the Temple

17:36.346 --> 17:39.183
and did everything to support
the Holy Knights and me.

17:39.266 --> 17:42.144
How dare you treat
such a great man like that...

17:42.227 --> 17:44.354
No... that's not it.

17:44.438 --> 17:46.273
Actually, it's... that.

17:46.356 --> 17:48.025
How should I put it...?

17:48.108 --> 17:51.111
I'd like to suggest tightening security
in the underground waterways...

18:05.000 --> 18:06.210
Run!

18:06.293 --> 18:07.544
Not that way!

18:07.628 --> 18:08.879
Go to the shelter!

18:11.006 --> 18:12.716
Xylo, they're charging from the front!

18:12.800 --> 18:13.675
Bogies!

18:13.759 --> 18:15.636
They're closing in from the right too!

18:15.719 --> 18:19.348
Good. Keep monitoring the situation.

18:19.431 --> 18:20.557
They're coming!

18:23.352 --> 18:24.978
This is really...

18:25.562 --> 18:27.856
Bogies are the bane of artillery.

18:27.940 --> 18:29.858
Comrade Xylo, I'm counting on you.

18:29.942 --> 18:31.151
I know.

18:39.409 --> 18:41.662
We're going in too, Teoritta!

18:41.745 --> 18:44.706
Yes. I give you my blessing!

18:55.926 --> 18:57.427
Get blown to bits!

19:00.013 --> 19:03.392
Just as I thought. In life,
you have to ally yourself with the heroes.

19:03.475 --> 19:05.602
I couldn't be happier.

19:06.436 --> 19:08.772
We're going in!
Straight to Tui Jia in one push--

19:08.856 --> 19:09.815
Wait!

19:10.399 --> 19:12.192
There's a warehouse in front of you.

19:12.276 --> 19:16.029
Um, it has the Verkle Development
Corporation's logo on it.

19:16.113 --> 19:17.614
There's a campfire over there.

19:17.698 --> 19:19.658
It looks like someone is hiding inside.

19:19.741 --> 19:21.493
The faeries have surrounded it too.

19:21.577 --> 19:23.495
It's become a shelter?

19:23.579 --> 19:25.164
Damn, what a hassle.

19:25.247 --> 19:27.708
Now, what should we do, Comrade Xylo?

19:27.791 --> 19:29.293
Xylo,

19:29.376 --> 19:31.837
this is a great and honorable fight.

19:33.005 --> 19:34.006
I...

19:34.715 --> 19:35.883
I know.

19:45.267 --> 19:48.353
Rhyno, I'm going to have you work
like your life depends on it.

19:48.437 --> 19:50.397
- So brace yourself!
- Of course.

19:51.940 --> 19:53.692
For the sake of complete strangers,

19:54.735 --> 19:56.612
I'm willing to sacrifice myself.

19:58.989 --> 20:01.033
This is getting interesting.

20:20.719 --> 20:23.013
Breaking flash seal hit confirmed.

20:23.096 --> 20:25.766
We really are a great team, aren't we?

20:25.849 --> 20:28.227
Especially you, Goddess Teoritta.

20:28.310 --> 20:30.229
Your power is outstanding.

20:30.312 --> 20:32.147
Y-Yes.

20:32.231 --> 20:36.610
But somehow, it is hard to accept
a compliment from you...

20:38.570 --> 20:41.073
You don't have to be so wary of me.

20:41.156 --> 20:43.242
We're not that different, you know.

20:43.325 --> 20:44.910
You two are nothing alike, okay?

20:45.619 --> 20:47.955
The Holy Knights should
be making their move soon.

20:48.038 --> 20:49.498
Isn't that right, Venetim?

20:49.581 --> 20:51.541
Huh? Oh, yes.

20:51.625 --> 20:54.419
I finally convinced them
to let Jayce deploy.

20:54.503 --> 20:56.546
I also had them block
the underground waterways.

20:56.630 --> 20:57.464
The waterways?

20:58.048 --> 20:59.466
Have they been invaded?

20:59.549 --> 21:02.302
No. Things were urgent then,
so I made it up.

21:02.803 --> 21:04.721
Made it up? You...

21:04.805 --> 21:07.015
No, I think it's a good idea.

21:07.099 --> 21:09.434
We should strengthen security in the city.

21:10.018 --> 21:13.563
Frenci and the men from night-gaunt
are on guard in the city.

21:13.647 --> 21:15.399
After all, we still have
Spriggan to deal with.

21:15.482 --> 21:16.525
Whoa, Xylo!

21:16.608 --> 21:19.152
Straight ahead! On the roof!

21:19.236 --> 21:20.696
This is bad!

21:20.779 --> 21:21.613
What?

21:21.697 --> 21:23.323
What's bad?

21:27.077 --> 21:28.912
Oh my, are those lightning staffs?

21:28.996 --> 21:30.956
I can't believe they can use sacred seals.

21:31.039 --> 21:32.249
Are you serious?

21:32.332 --> 21:35.252
Are the coexisters behind this? Rhyno!

21:36.670 --> 21:37.963
I see.

21:50.183 --> 21:51.351
I'm unharmed.

21:51.435 --> 21:54.104
But my luminescence is a little low.

21:56.898 --> 21:59.526
Damn it. I was going to slip into an alley
to avoid their beams, but...

21:59.609 --> 22:01.987
I don't think we have time
to take a detour.

22:02.070 --> 22:03.280
Hey, stop--

22:14.124 --> 22:17.002
Th-The civilians' homes have been...

22:17.085 --> 22:20.213
Yes, saving lives comes first.

22:20.797 --> 22:22.758
That's not the point...

22:23.258 --> 22:24.760
Alright, let's go.

22:25.343 --> 22:27.596
To the trapped civilians!

22:28.138 --> 22:30.307
- Go!
- Annihilate them!

22:32.100 --> 22:34.269
Don't let them invade the Inland District!

22:34.352 --> 22:35.604
Fire!

22:38.273 --> 22:40.442
All right, they're the last ones.

22:40.525 --> 22:41.777
Fire!

22:43.236 --> 22:46.615
It's been sealed off?

22:46.698 --> 22:51.244
The plan was for the faeries to invade
through the underground waterways.

22:51.328 --> 22:53.622
Excellent tactical insight.

22:54.414 --> 22:56.374
I respect that.

22:56.958 --> 22:58.752
What's going on? There's something here.

22:58.835 --> 22:59.711
Is it a faerie?

23:00.295 --> 23:01.546
What? A human?

23:01.630 --> 23:03.673
Who are you? What are you doing there?

23:03.757 --> 23:05.258
Everyone,

23:05.342 --> 23:07.886
I hope you don't resist.

23:08.470 --> 23:11.473
It would be too pitiful to die in pain.

23:33.411 --> 23:34.496
Uncle!

23:34.579 --> 23:35.914
Patausche.

23:35.997 --> 23:37.499
You're here.

23:37.582 --> 23:40.335
I heard there are faeries
in the Inland District too...

23:40.418 --> 23:43.463
Yes, the guards reported it to me.

23:43.547 --> 23:45.882
It seems they invaded
through the underground ruins.

23:56.601 --> 23:59.479
The military and the Temple
are working together...

23:59.563 --> 24:02.399
Uncle, did you organize
the soldiers yourself?

24:02.482 --> 24:05.610
After all, this is not the time for us
to turn against each other.

24:05.694 --> 24:08.196
If I can't get the two groups
to work together,

24:08.280 --> 24:10.115
what's the point of me
being the High Priest?

24:10.824 --> 24:12.159
Let's use this crisis

24:12.242 --> 24:15.120
to strengthen the unity
between the military and the Temple.

24:15.704 --> 24:20.584
Such a bond will lead humanity to victory.

24:21.168 --> 24:22.294
Uncle...

24:24.629 --> 24:27.883
Your ambition truly inspires me.

24:27.966 --> 24:30.385
I'm counting on you, Patausche.

24:30.468 --> 24:32.762
Let's overcome this trial together.

24:32.846 --> 24:33.805
Yes.

24:39.728 --> 24:43.148
May the blessings
of Saint Mahaeyzel be with us.

24:45.901 --> 24:48.069
All right, we're switching
from defense to offense.
